<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">EFEDZE</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool ola baal a Efedzɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efedziɛ̃</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool ola baal a</para>
  <para style="mt">Efedze</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool, mɛ̃ ndi ntam a Yeso Mãsia, m'emfa ki edzii Nziã. Mɛ̃ nkel ola baal ba ngel b'ali k'Efedze, b'abekuru nzuru me Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="EPH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã wu Tal a bia-byɛ ye Mfam Yeso Mãsia asio byɛ nyiĩ, awa byɛ opi!<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl b'ɔ̃fel onse Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Bia-byɛ elweel Nziã wu Tal a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia! Ndɛ wɛn onse Mãsia, ámaawa bia-byɛ ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl bueel b'ɔ̃fel ke ywel. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Onse Mãsia, ndɛ ál'ámaasuaal bia-byɛ ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ye k'esa ndɛ ɔ̃kiri, me ndɔɔ yɛn bia-byɛ ekal baal a ndɛ bvool eywɛn elyal ke mviil ã ndɛ. Nziã onse dzii e ndɛ, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn ámaasuaal bia-byɛ k'ekal baan a ndɛ me nkuul a Yeso Mãsia. Ndɛ ádzii obobɔ onse obvɛ o ndɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Obobɔ, elweel Nziã me ndɔɔ ekab li ebvɛ-ebvɛ li éwi ndɛ bia-byɛ me nyiĩ a ndɛ onse Muaan a ndɛ wa dzii.<verse eid="EPH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Onse Mãsia, Nziã amaabvuul bia-byɛ bvool amaadzeel ãbi ã bia-byɛ m'ãkel ã ndɛ. Obobɔ, Nziã ŋ'asuo bia-byɛ kwɛn nyiĩ a ndɛ eli yam yi nɛn. <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />Nyiĩ oyɔ, ndɛ ásio bia-byɛ yɔ yam ngamfɛn, y'ãyal y'ontwel bueel. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Ndɛ ŋ'asuo bia-byɛ ãndɔɔ mã m'edziɔɔn m'ébvam ndɛ, m'emfa ki ɔ̃yɛɛl wu ɔ̃bvɛ wu éwel ndɛ onse ndɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Ɔ̃yɛɛl ondɛ, Nziã àsuul ndɛ àkoo ŋ'èkoo ãlio, ndɛ oli bubu: Nziã àbvool eluɔ bvieel onse Mãsia, bvi ke ywel ye bvi me nsie.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Onse Mãsia bia-byɛ emeebɔɔ boo li ɔ̃swal li bia-byɛ, bia-byɛ bɛn tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn amaasuaal, m'emfa ki ɔ̃yɛɛl a wu abesa mbueel m'emfa ki ébvam ndɛ bvool ki édzii ndɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Obobɔ, bia-byɛ elweel okuun o Nziã, bia-byɛ b'eli baal b'ɛ̃kwel b'élɔ kaã e bia-byɛ onse Mãsia! <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Onse ndɛ, byɛ hɛ̃, byɛ eyoo Endɔɔ li taa-taa, Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ébvuul byɛ. Onse ndɛ bvool, byɛ ekiool, obobɔ Nziã osi byɛ eliĩ. Eliĩ okyɛ, ki Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, wu élieel Nziã ndiri àwa byɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Ɔ̃fel ondɛ oli nsoo yi ɔ̃swal a bia-byɛ, tiil k'ekal obvuul o bia-byɛ ɔ̃koo, me lio li ekieel ewal bia-byɛ ɔ̃swal ondɛ. Oŋɔ̃ elweel okuun o Nziã!<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebuɛɛn e Pool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, ŋe ngyoo mɛ̃ ɔ̃sam wu okiool o byɛ onse Mfam Yeso ye wa dzii li edzii byɛ akiool bam bueel, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />mɛ̃ k'ebeyɔɔl k'ebveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a byɛ wɛ. Mɛ̃ ebetsam me ndɔɔ a byɛ onse ãbuɛɛn ã mɛ̃. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ebebii ola Nziã a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia, Taal nga-omfam, kwɛn Ɔ̃fel a ndɛ awa byɛ ãyal, asuo byɛ hɛ̃ Nziã kwɛn byɛ eyɛɛ ndɛ ngesɛ-ngesɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Mɛ̃ ebebuɛɛn hɛ̃ kwɛn ndɛ ayɛɛl mviil m'ɔ̃kwal a byɛ, kwɛn byɛ eyɛɛ kaã li eli onse mbel yi eti ndɛ byɛ, y'opfel b'onɛn b'eluɔ bvi èwa ndɛ baal ba ngel. <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />Obobɔ, byɛ hɛ̃ eyɛɛ waan e ndɛ li enduru okuun, li ésuo ndɛ bia-byɛ b'akiool ye mpɛn yam bibi. <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />Waan olɔ, Nziã ásuo lɔ onse Mãsia ŋ'éseel ndɛ ndɛ onse b'ákwi-ákwi bvool ásuul ndɛ me nsɛn ke ywel, me nkuɔɔl e ndɛ ki elam. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Asuul Mãsia oŋɔ̃ ke ywel okwɛn bueel, ke ywel waan lueel, ke ywel omfam bueel, bvool ke ywel a mpɛn yueel, ye nkuun yueel yɛn akoo k'atuaal, ke kɛn a me lio li wɛ, akoo k'atuaal yɔ hɛ̃ onse ɔ̃kiri wu akieel aya. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Nziã álɔ eluɔ bvieel ke nsɛn a ntaan e Mãsia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ oyɔ ákel yɔ onse ɔ̃nkaan wu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 8:7">Ãnz 8.7</ref></char></note>, bvool ásuul ndɛ ɔ̃tswɛ wu Ebvɔɔn m'ãndɔɔ mbueel. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Lɔ eli nzuru a Mãsia, lɔ eluul me ndɛ wu abeluul eluɔ bvieel m'ãboo mbueel.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Obvuul me nyiĩ a Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Byɛ tsɔɔn ékwi me ndɔɔ elyal e byɛ, me ndɔɔ ãbi ã byɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Me lio olɔ, byɛ ékenɔɔn epfuũ bvi ɔ̃kiri wu, byɛ ékelweel mfam a ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi mi eli y'okwɛn mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a ywel ye nsie. Mfam ondɛ, wu abesal meba onse baal bɛn k'awa Nziã bvɛɛ wɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Bia-byɛ bam bueel tsɔɔn éli onge baal obɔ, ŋ'ékenɔɔn bia-byɛ efua e bia-byɛ bvi ebi-ebi, bvool ŋ'ékesa bia-byɛ ãndɔɔ m'edzii nzuru y'ãtsam ã bia-byɛ. Obobɔ, m'emfa ki éli bia-byɛ, bia-byɛ éli baal bɛn mpuru a Nziã ebvaan ekeebva nkal a bia-byɛ onge bakyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Kɛn a Nziã oluul me nyiĩ, bvool ndɛ odzii bia-byɛ me dzii li nɛn. <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, bia-byɛ b'ékwi me ndɔɔ elyal e bia-byɛ, ndɛ oseel bia-byɛ ye Mãsia. Byɛ me nyiĩ a Nziã ebvuul. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Mboo mɔ̃ ye Yeso-Mãsia, Nziã áseel bia-byɛ, bvool ámvieel bia-byɛ nsɛn ke ywel. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Nziã ási obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yi asuo bia-byɛ m'ãlio mbueel m'ãkieel ãya, kwɛn nyiĩ a ndɛ eli yam yi enɛn, nyiĩ yi ésuo ndɛ bia-byɛ m'obvɛ o ndɛ onse Yeso-Mãsia. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ me nyiĩ a Nziã ebvuul, me nkuul okiool o byɛ. Obvuul obɔ k'ofi ola byɛ wɛ, bɔ oli kab e Nziã. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Bɔ k'ofa m'ɛ̃sal wɛ, kwɛn mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ abee ntwel obɛɛl. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, wu ási bia-byɛ, eli Nziã. Ndɛ ábuo bia-byɛ onse Yeso-Mãsia kwɛn bia-byɛ esa ɛ̃sal mi ngesɛ, ɛ̃sal mi éfaal ndɛ wu Nziã ŋ'ɛ̃kwel-ɛ̃kwel, kwɛn bia-byɛ esa myɛ̃.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃mɔ̃ onse Yeso-Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, eyɛɛ bubu: Byɛ eli bɛn tsɔɔn k'éli Ayuda b'emburu-ngoo wɛ, bɛn b'átsiil nzuru áketa byɛ me «Baal bɛn k'átsiil nzuru wɛ», bɔ b'átsiil m'emfa ki ombuul bvool me kuɔɔl e mbuul. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Me lio olɔ, byɛ éli lala ye Mãsia, byɛ éli anzii onse yam li Isalayel. Ãndɔɔ m'élieel Nziã ndiri àsa onse ondoo b'étɛn ndɛ ye baal a ndɛ, k'ã́tal byɛ wɛ. Onse ɔ̃kiri, byɛ k'éli ye kaã wɛ, k'éli ye Nziã hɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Kɛn a meba, byɛ bɛn tsɔɔn éli lala ye Nziã, onse Mãsia, amaasiaal byɛ tsotsoo ye ndɛ, me nkuul a ãkel ã ndɛ wu Mãsia.<verse eid="EPH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ wu oli opi o bia-byɛ, ndɛ wu osi kwɛn Ayuda ye baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ akal yam ngelemɔ̃. Ŋ'ewi ndɛ nzuru a ndɛ, ndɛ obal ebɔɔ ki otaal ki ékekab bɔ. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Ndɛ ombaal dzuun e Ngel a Moyize y'ãndɔɔ m'etam yɔ osa y'ɛ̃kiri ɛ̃ yɔ, kwɛn onse ndɛ, m'Ayuda ye bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, ndɛ abuo mbuul wu ɔ̃nyiɔɔn, m'olɔ b'opi. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />M'enkulusu, ndɛ obvool ãyam omɔ̃ ãnge-mbuaal, osi kwɛn mɔ̃ ãyii nzuru ngamɔ̃ ye Nziã. Me kyɛ, ndɛ obam otaal. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Ndɛ oyetee Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi opi ola byɛ b'éli lala ye Nziã, bvool ola bɔ b'áli tsotsoo ye Nziã<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Edz 57.19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Ke ngwel wɛ, me ndɛ, Ayuda ye bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, bia-byɛ bueel eli ye mpwee yi eyi ke nkwel a Taal, m'Ɔ̃fel ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="EPH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Obobɔ, byɛ bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, byɛ bvool k'ebekal anzii wuo ɛ̃mbwel-nkuul wɛ, kɛn a byɛ ŋ'eyii anga-ola mboo mɔ̃ ye baal ba ngel, baal a nzɔ a Nziã. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Byɛ eli nzɔ yɛn antam y'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ali ãnkɔɔn m'atuu yɔ nkal a mɔ̃. Mãsia ndyam wu oli nkɔɔn yi nkiin yi nzɔ oyɔ. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Me ndɛ, nzɔ yueel ebvɔɔn mboo mɔ̃ bvool etɛɛn, kwɛn yɔ ekal nzɔ yi ngel onse Mfam. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Onse ndɛ, atuu byɛ mboo mɔ̃, kwɛn byɛ ekal nzɔ yi ekal Nziã onse yɔ me nkuul a Ɔ̃fel.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃sal a Pool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool, mɛ̃ ndi mbuul a bwal a Yeso-Mãsia me ndɔɔ a byɛ bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Byɛ oŋɔ̃ emeeyoo kwɛn Nziã, onse nyiĩ a ndɛ, áwi mɛ̃ ɔ̃sal wu me ndɔɔ a byɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Ndɛ áyɛɛl mɛ̃ ɔ̃yɛɛl wu áli m'edziɔɔn ondɛ, onge be nkel mɛ̃ byɛ tsɔɔn etsi-tsiri. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Ŋ'ètsiɔ byɛ ãndɔɔ me nkel mɛ̃, byɛ ekoo k'etaal ãyal me ndi a mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ ɔ̃yɛɛl wa m'edziɔɔn wu otal Mãsia. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Ɔ̃yɛɛl wa m'edziɔɔn ondɛ, m'ãlio m'ãbwel tsɔɔn, Nziã k'ásuo ndɛ ola baal wɛ, m'emfa ki esuo ndɛ ndɛ meba m'Ɔ̃fel ol'antam y'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a ndɛ ba ngel. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Ɔ̃yɛɛl ondɛ oli bubu: Baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ y'Ayuda abɔɔ ɔ̃swal wuwu wu ékwee Nziã baal a ndɛ, ayii nzuru ngamɔ̃ ye bɔ, abvɔɔn onse ndɔɔ yiyi yi élieel Nziã ndiri àsa onse Yeso-Mãsia, me nkuul a Nsia yi Ngesɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Mɛ̃ ngyii ɔ̃sal wu etee Nsia yi Ngesɛ oyɔ, me kab li ewi Nziã mɛ̃ onse nyiĩ a ndɛ, me waan e ndɛ li ebesal onse mɛ̃. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Mɛ̃ wu mvool mbee onse baal a Nziã bueel ba ngel, Nziã osio mɛ̃ nyiĩ oyɔ, kwɛn mɛ̃ ntee baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ opfel o Mãsia b'oywɛn ɔ̃ndel. <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />Nziã hɛ̃ osio mɛ̃ nyiĩ, kwɛn mɛ̃ nsuo baal bueel kal-a-kal emfa ki ekoo ɔ̃yɛɛl wu áli m'edziɔɔn ãlio mbueel onse Nziã, ndɛ wu ábuo eluɔ bvieel. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />M'emfa okyɛ, ãkwɛn y'ãwaan mã ke ywel meba ãyɛɛ ãyal ã Nziã, me nkuul a Ebvɔɔn. Ãyal omɔ̃, Nziã abesuo mɔ̃ m'emfa bwɛn a emfa, <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />m'emfa ki ɔ̃yɛɛl wu ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu wu ésuul ndɛ ákoo onse Yeso-Mãsia wu Mfam a bia-byɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Onse ndɛ, m'okiool me ndɛ, bia-byɛ eyii ndii me ndɔɔ yi esyal tsotsoo a Nziã ye kaã lueel. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mɛ̃ eluɔɔn byɛ wɛn ebee owɔɔl me ndɔɔ ãmpal m'emwɛn mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a byɛ, ke ngwel wɛ mɔ̃ ãli lweel e byɛ.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dzii e Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mɛ̃ ebebva ãbuo ke nkwel a Taal, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />ndɛ wɛn ãyam mbueel ke ywel ye nsie ãbɔɔ nkuũ a ndɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Mɛ̃ ebebuɛɛn kwɛn, m'opfel b'onduru okuun bo lweel e ndɛ, ndɛ awa byɛ mpɛn ye waan m'Ɔ̃fel a ndɛ, kwɛn byɛ ewam onse ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Mãsia akal onse ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ me nkuul a okiool! Bvool yɔɔl kwɛn byɛ elɔ ɛ̃dza bvool etuu elaã e byɛ onse dzii. <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />M'emfa okyɛ, byɛ ol'ebɔɔ mpɛn, ye baal a ngel bueel, yi ekwaal otsɛn b'ola, y'ɔ̃tyal, ye dzio, y'ɔ̃tɔɔl a dzii e Mãsia, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />kwɛn byɛ eyɛɛ dzii olɔ li enduru ãndɔɔ mɛn mbuul okoo k'ayɛɛ, m'emfa okyɛ byɛ eluul m'ɔ̃tsiin a Nziã.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Ola Nziã wɛn, me waan e ndɛ li esal onse bia-byɛ, okoo k'asa bam m'onduru o mam mbueel m'esɔɔ wuo m'etsam bia-byɛ, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />yɔɔl kwɛn lweel ekal ye ndɛ onse Ebvɔɔn bvool onse Yeso-Mãsia, ãlio mbueel, ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. Amɛn!<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Bvoo wu Ɔ̃fel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Mɛ̃ wu mbuul a bwal me ndɔɔ a Mfam, mɛ̃ eluɔɔn byɛ bam k'edzuu m'emfa ki ebvaan me mbel yi áti byɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Ekal y'okuaal o nzuru, ekal y'efyɛ, ekal hɛ̃ y'osɛ-mwiĩ. Onse dzii, ekuru ɛ̃kwal onse byam-a-byam. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Esa mpɛn me ndɔɔ yi ekal kɛn okal onse bvoo wu ewa Ɔ̃fel me nkuul yi opi b'obvool byɛ bɛn ye bɛn. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Nzuru eli kɛn a ngamɔ̃, Ɔ̃fel hɛ̃ oli kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃, emfa kiki hɛ̃ eli kɛn a ye kaã ngemɔ̃ li áti byɛ mbel ke lɔ.<verse eid="EPH 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Mfam oli kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃, okiool oli kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃, opongo hɛ̃ oli kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃.<verse eid="EPH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Nziã wu Tal a baal bam bueel oli kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:6">ndɛ oli ke ywel a baal bueel, abesal me baal bueel bvool oli onse baal bueel.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃ ngɔmɔ̃ onse bia-byɛ áyɔɔ nyiĩ a Nziã, m'emvɛɛl e kab li ewa Mãsia.<verse eid="EPH 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, ayɛɛn onse Ɔ̃nkaan ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">«Ŋ'éwueel ndɛ ywel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">ndɛ ábiri b'áli me bwal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">ndɛ áwi baal ãkab<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:19">Ãnz 68.19</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />K'oyɛɛn ba: «Ndɛ áwueel ywel», ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri emã? Bɔ ŋ'oyɛɛn ndiri ye k'ewuaal ndɛ, ndɛ kɛn ásool bam ke nsɛn a nsie. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Mbuul wu ásool, kɛn a ndɛ wu-wu wu áwueel bam ánduru ywel lam lueel, me ndɔɔ yi aluul eluɔ bvieel. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Ndyam mbuul wu áwi ekab ola baal bɛn k'akal antam, ola bɛn k'akal aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, ola bɛn k'akal aliaal a Nsia yi Ngesɛ, ola bɛn k'akal ambiri a baal, bvool ola bɛn k'akal ayiool. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Ndɛ ási obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yi afaal baal ba ngel k'akoo k'asa ɔ̃sal a bɔ, me ndɔɔ otuu o nzuru a Mãsia, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />tiil ye k'etɔ bia-byɛ bam bueel ke bvoo wu okiool, y'oyɛɛ o Muaan a Nziã ngesɛ-ngesɛ, y'okal o baal b'amaayal, m'emfa ki ɔ̃koo ki ɔ̃tyal a Mãsia. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Obobɔ, bia-byɛ bvool k'ebekal ebe-baan bvi ebwee wɛ, bvɛn epɔɔ efa a bɔ ngwel ebwel a bɔ ngwel, bvɛn amfel bueel b'ãtee abiri, aywɔɔn a bɔ, bvool bɛn baal b'apfuru bakyɛ m'ãyal m'ãbi adzeel. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Kɛn a m'oyɛɛn b'otaa-taa, onse dzii, bia-byɛ èkwel m'ãndɔɔ mbueel tiil ola ndɛ wu oli ɔ̃tswɛ, ndɛ wu Mãsia. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Me ndɛ, elyam e nzuru bvieel eli mboo mɔ̃ bvool ebvɔɔn. Ãmboo m'ebvɔɔn elyam bibi, esa kwɛn nzuru ebvɔɔn mboo mɔ̃, bvool ŋɛn elyam bwɛn elyam esi ɔ̃sal a kyɛ, nzuru yam yueel ekwel bvool ewam yam a yam onse dzii.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elaã li enyiɔɔn onse Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Obobɔ, etal be nzii mɛ̃ byɛ oliaal, bvool mɛ̃ eyɛɛn yɔ ekwal onse Mfam bubu: Ebee okal onge baal bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ, b'abenɔɔn ãtsam ã bɔ mã ngwel-a-ngwel. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ãtsam ã bɔ ãli onse empeel, bvool bɔ ali lala y'elaã e Nziã, m'odzɛɛn b'oli onse bɔ, m'ɔ̃kwal mpɛn a bɔ. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Bɔ k'abeyɛɛ wɛn ba obi, ba obvɛ wɛ. Bɔ ámaawa ãnzuru ã bɔ k'asa ãndɔɔ m'esio, kwɛn ye pfuul o nzi bueel, bɔ asa ãndɔɔ mã mbiin m'emfa bwɛn emfa. <verse eid="EPH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Kɛn a byɛ, byɛ Mãsia ke m'emfa okyɛ éyio wɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ éyoo ɔ̃sam wu emfa ki eli ndɛ. Onse ndɛ, áyiool byɛ hɛ̃ m'emfa ki otaa-taa b'onse ndɛ wu Yeso. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Obobɔ, ebee epfuũ e byɛ bvi tsɔɔn, eyɔɔl ombuul o byɛ bo tsɔɔn. Ke ngwel wɛ, efua e bɔ bvi pfuru ebebiri byɛ k'obii. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Eyɔɔl Ɔ̃fel asuul ãyal ã byɛ ãkal m'ãnyiɔɔn. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Elaal mbuul wu ɔ̃nyiɔɔn, wu ábuo m'emfa e Nziã, onse okal dzu, y'onsensal b'ofa onse otaa-taa.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Obobɔ, eyɔɔl mfya. Mbuul bwɛn a mbuul aliaal ngaburu-mbuul otaa-taa, ke ngwel wɛ bia-byɛ bueel eli elyam e nzuru ngamɔ̃. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Ŋɛn byɛ eyi mpuru, èbee obi osa, mpuru a byɛ efa ye k'edziin tal. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Ebee ɔ̃pfu mpwee owa. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul wu aketuru pfuul abee obeturu. Kɛn a ndɛ ebvaan asa mpɛn yi asa ɔ̃sal wa ngesɛ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ ndyam, kwɛn ndɛ abɔɔ ki awa mbuul wu okaan. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Yɔɔl kwɛn ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ yi mbi-mbi ebee m'ɔ̃nywã a byɛ opal. Eyɛɛn kɛn a ãndɔɔ m'ãbvɛ-ãbvɛ m'ãwuaal a bakyɛ m'emfa ki ãkɔɔ ã bɔ, bvool m'ãsa obvɛ ola baal b'ayoo mɔ̃. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Ebee Ɔ̃fel a Nziã wu Ɔ̃nsensal ãwua owa, wɛn me ndɛ ási byɛ eliĩ, me ndɔɔ a tsoo li obvuul. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Eyɔɔl kwɛn ɔ̃lyɛn, mpuru, oya o mpuru, ota b'ɛ̃pal, ɛ̃tswɛ, y'ãndɔɔ mbueel m'ãbi, ãmbal onse byɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Ekal baal ba ngɛsɛ bɛn ola bɛn, ekal ye nyiĩ a bakyɛ. Edzeel byam-a-byam, onge b'édzeel Nziã byɛ onse Mãsia.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Epfuũ bvi ebvaan me baal ba ngel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Onge bɛn byɛ eli baan b'ebedzii Nziã, eluɛɛn kuul e ndɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Edzuu onse dzii, onge b'édzii Mãsia bia-byɛ, bvool áwi elaã e ndɛ me ndyam ola Nziã me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ, onge kab bvool onge ãnãsi mã nswel yi ngesɛ.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Yɔɔl kwɛn obvool o ntal ye mbuul wɛn byɛ kɛn ebaal bakyɛ wɛ y'ãndɔɔ mbueel mã mbiin m'emfa bwɛn a emfa, wuo ɔ̃tam, abee bvɛ bam otuaal onse byɛ, ke ngwel wɛ omɔ̃ k'ãndɔɔ m'ãbvaan me baal ba ngel wɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃, ãndɔɔ m'opfuru, ye siaal wuo ãndɔɔ mã ngwel-a-ngwel, k'ãbvaan me byɛ wɛ, ki ebvaan kɛn obveel o Nziã ãtuɛɛn. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Ke ngwel wɛ, eyɛɛ ngesɛ wɛn mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ wu asa esio, wu asa ãndɔɔ mã mbiin, wuo wu oli y'ɔ̃tam, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri obuɛɛn b'anziã ba mfya, k'akoo k'abɔɔ mboo onse okwɛn o Mãsia ye Nziã wɛ.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okal onse mwiĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Mbuul abee byɛ opfuru m'ãndɔɔ mɛn otsɛn pyɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, eli me ndɔɔ a ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ kwɛn mpuru a Nziã eya nkal a baal b'aywɛn a lweel. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Obobɔ, ebee ye baal obɔ obvɔɔn. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ tsɔɔn éli onse empeel, kɛn a meba ŋã, byɛ eyii onse mwiĩ onse Mfam. Obobɔ, ekal onge baan a mwiĩ. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Ke ngwel wɛ, nsia e mwiĩ eli ãndɔɔ mbueel m'ãbvɛ-ãbvɛ, ye mã dzu ye mã taa-taa. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Ebii k'eyɛɛ ãndɔɔ m'edzii Mfam. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Ebee osam onse ɛ̃sal mi empeel myɛn k'eburu nsia wɛ, epaal myɛ̃ ke taan. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ãndɔɔ m'ebesa baal obɔ m'edziɔɔn, eli y'opfuru bam m'oyɛɛn o mɔ̃. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Kɛn a ŋ'apaal ɛ̃sal omyɛ̃ ke taan, oŋɔ̃ mwiĩ oyɛɛl myɛ̃. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mam mbueel m'ayɛɛl ãli mwiĩ. Obɔ otsɛn b'áyɛɛn ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">«Siool, yɛ wu alaal twal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">Tɛɛn onse b'ákwi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">obobɔ Mãsia àyɛɛl yɛ.»<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Obobɔ, ekal bam y'onkyab m'emfa ki ekal byɛ. Ebee okal onge ewool, ekal onge anga-ãyal. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Me lio li ebɔɔ byɛ mpwee, esa obvɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ãtsoo ãli ãbi-ãbi. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, ebee ewool okal, kɛn ebii k'eyɛɛ b'edzii Mfam.<verse eid="EPH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Mbal ãbee byɛ obɔɔ, ke ngwel wɛ mɔ̃ ãbebiri baal onse ɛ̃tsab. Kɛn eluul m'Ɔ̃fel. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Embuɔ ye bakyɛ m'ãnziĩ m'emfa bwɛn emfa m'ãfa ol'Ɔ̃fel. Eyam bvool elweel Nziã m'ɔ̃kwal a byɛ ndyam wueel. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />M'ãlio mbueel bvool m'ãndɔɔ mbueel, ebveel Nziã wu Taal ãtuɛɛn, me nkuũ a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akal y'alam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Ewa bakyɛ dzuun me ndɔɔ a bvɛɛ li ewa byɛ Mãsia. <verse eid="EPH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Obobɔ, byɛ b'akal, yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul awa ɔ̃lam a ndɛ dzuun, onge b'ewa byɛ Mfam dzuun. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ɔ̃lam oli mfam a ɔ̃kal, onge b'eli Mãsia Mfam a Ebvɔɔn li eli nzuru a ndɛ, lɛn ndɛ oli Ɔ̃mvuul. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Obobɔ, akal ebvaan awa alam a bɔ dzuun m'ãndɔɔ mbueel, onge b'ebewa Ebvɔɔn Mãsia dzuun.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Byɛ b'alam, yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul adzii ɔ̃kal a ndɛ onge b'édzii Mãsia Ebvɔɔn, bvool áwi elaã e ndɛ me ndyam me ndɔɔ a lɔ, <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />me ndɔɔ yi asa kwɛn lɔ ekal li ngel, ŋ'esuul ndɛ lɔ eyii tsɛtsɛ m'osuɔɔl o lɔ m'ãdza y'eyɛɛn. <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />Ndɛ ádzii k'ásuul Ebvɔɔn olɔ ke nkwel a ndyam eluul me dzuun, eywɛn a mbiin, eywɛn a nkaã, wuo eluɔ ngemɔ̃ ki obobɔ, kɛn a lɔ ekal li ngel bvool lɛn elyal si ngemɔ̃ pyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Emfa kiki, alam ebvaan adzii akal a bɔ onge ãnzuru ã bam. Mbuul wu odzii ɔ̃kal a ndɛ wu odzii nzuru a ndyam. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul lɔɔ-okal kɛn abyel nzuru a ndyam wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ abeliil yɔ bvool abefaal yɔ ngesɛ-ngesɛ, emfa okyɛ hɛ̃ ki ebesa Mãsia m'Ebvɔɔn, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />ke ngwel wɛ, bia-byɛ eli elyam e nzuru a ndɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã olieel ndiri: «Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, bɔɔl akieel ambal ola tal a ndɛ ye ngoo a ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi abvɔɔn y'ɔ̃kal a ndɛ. Obobɔ, bɔ ange-buaal akieel akal kɛn a mbuul ngɔmɔ̃<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Obɛ 2.24</ref></char></note>». <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Onse oŋɔ̃, eli ye ndɔɔ ngamɔ̃ yi enɛn yi eli m'edziɔɔn, mɛ̃ ndyam eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn yɔ etal Mãsia y'Ebvɔɔn. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Me b'otal byɛ, ebvaan kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul onse byɛ adzii ɔ̃kal a ndɛ onge ndyam. Ɔ̃kal hɛ̃ ebvaan awa ɔ̃lam a ndɛ dzuun.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Atal y'angoo ye baan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Byɛ be baan, ewaa atal y'angoo a byɛ dzuun, m'emfa ki edzii Mfam, ke ngwel wɛ oyɔ ndɔɔ yi dzu. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />«Lweel tal ye ngoo», oyɔ ngel yi ɛ̃kwel yi eli ye ndɔɔ yi élieel Nziã ndiri asa, ndiri: <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />«Kwɛn omwiĩ o yɛ okal ngesɛ bvool yɛ kal y'elaã li ela me nsie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Opa 20.12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Det 5.16</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Byɛ b'atal, ebee baan a byɛ mpuru owa. Kɛn ekuul bɔ m'ãtee y'ãluo ã Mfam.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ankyal y'amfam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Byɛ b'ankyal, elweel amfam a byɛ ba me nsie ŋã y'etiɔɔl ye bvɛɛ, m'otaa-taa bueel, onge b'elweel byɛ Mãsia. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Ebee obobɔ osa kɛn a ŋ'etal bɔ byɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ edzii k'ewa bɔ esɛ. Esa kɛn a b'edzii Nziã ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃, onge ankyal a Mãsia. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Esa ɔ̃sal a byɛ y'esɛ kieel, onge bɛn byɛ ɔ̃sal a Mfam esa, ke wa baal wɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Eyɛɛ kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul, ekal ɔ̃nkyal wuo mbuul wɛn k'ɔ̃nkyal wɛ, akieel abɔɔ furu e ndɛ ola Mfam m'obvɛ bɛn ndyam kieel amaasa.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Byɛ b'amfam, esa hɛ̃ emfa kiki m'ankyal a byɛ. Ebee bɔ oŋaan. Eyɛɛ wɛn byɛ y'ankyal a byɛ Mfam oli wuwu ke ywel, bvool ola ndɛ ɔ̃bɛɛ pyɛ.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ãta ã Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />M'osɛɛl, ekal ye mpɛn onse Mfam bvool me mpɛn a ndɛ yi eli ke ywel a mbueel. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Elaal ãta ã Nziã mam mbueel, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ byɛ esɛn ãnã ke nkwel ãyal m'ɔ̃pfu m'ãbi-ãbi. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mvel a bia-byɛ ke yi adzwaan ye baal wɛ, yi adzwaan y'ɛ̃fel mi y'okwɛn, y'ɛ̃fel mi ye mpɛn, ye mi y'omfam b'ɔ̃kiri wu empeel wu, y'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi mi ɛ̃li mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ ywel ye nsie.<verse eid="EPH 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Obobɔ, ewal ãta ã Nziã mam mbueel, kwɛn byɛ ekoo k'epio ãnã me tsoo li ebi, bvool kwɛn ke mbee a ŋ'edzwaan byɛ tiil ntɔ, byɛ ekal kɛn a tɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Ngwanyã, esɛn ãnã: Elaal otaa-taa onge ɔ̃sii me luu, bvool elaal ãndɔɔ mã dzu onge eluɔ ki bvieel ki efoo otwel. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Elaal ãtsam m'ãbvɛ m'ewa Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi opi onge asimpal me ntaã. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />M'ãndɔɔ mbueel, ewal okiool onge eluɔ ki bvieel ki esa kwɛ byɛ etɛɛl ãyuo ã mbaa mbueel m'eyuɔɔl Ɔ̃biil. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Ewal ekɔrɔ ki bvieel ki obvuul, y'epwel ki Ɔ̃fel, ki eli Endɔɔ e Nziã.<verse eid="EPH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Ãlio mbueel, m'Ɔ̃fel, esa ãbuɛɛn mbueel m'emfa bwɛn a emfa m'osɔɔ b'eluɔ ye m'oluɔɔn. Obobɔ, ekal angɔ-mwiĩ, bvool ekal y'ɔ̃tɛɛ̃. Ebuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a baal ba ngel bueel. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Ebuɛɛn hɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃, kwɛn oŋɔ̃, me lio li edzweel mɛ̃ ɔ̃nywã, Nziã awa mɛ̃ Endɔɔ lɛn ebvaan mɛ̃ eyɛɛn, me ndɔɔ yi esuo baal ndɔɔ yi m'edziɔɔn yi Nsiã yi Ngesɛ y'onzɔɔ̃ bueel.<verse eid="EPH 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Me ndɔɔ a yɔ mɛ̃ ndi ntam a Nsia yi Ngesɛ onse ebwal. Ebuɛɛn me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn y'onzɔɔ̃, m'emfa kyɛn ebvaan mɛ̃ eyɛɛn.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio wa ntɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Tiswik, ndɔɔ a bee wu ɔ̃tio bvool wu oli ɔ̃sal wa dzu onse Mfam, awa byɛ nsia a mɛ̃ ye m'ebesa mɛ̃, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ byɛ hɛ̃ eyɛɛ emfa ki ndi mɛ̃. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Tal otsɛn be ngyuɔɔl mɛ̃ byɛ ndɛ, kwɛn byɛ ebɔɔ ãnsia m'ola bee, bvool ndɛ awa byɛ mpɛn.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã wu Taal ye Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso-Mãsia awa andoo a dzii bueel opi, ye dzii y'okiool! <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã asio baal bueel b'adzii Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso-Mãsia me dzii lɛn k'efa wɛ nyiĩ!<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>